    "chunk_text": "gunnon, Song he se m\u00e6ssepreost & r\u00e6dde orationem, \u00fea \u00f0e wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re a\u00f0le awritene w\u00e6ron, & \u00fea \u00feing Mid \u00fey heora \u00fea n\u00e6nig \u00e6nige helpe him findan meahte, \u00fea cwom semninga \u00fe\u00e6re abbudessan in \u00dea het heo sona hira \u00feinenne gaan & \u00fea cyste hire to gefetigan, \u00fee seo molde in w\u00e6s. \u00dea heo \u00fea mid \u00fea cyste in \u00feone cafertun eode \u00fe\u00e6s huses, \u00fee se feondseoca mon in \u00fer\u00e6sted w\u00e6s, \u00fea \u00dea swigodon heo eac ealle & stille w\u00e6ron; & sorgiende bidon to hwon his \u00feing weor\u00f0an scolde. \u00d0a w\u00e6s efter medmicelre tide f\u00e6ce \u00f0\u00e6t he upp as\u00e6t & hefiglice asworette & cw\u00e6\u00f0: Nu ic wat Ond heo \u00fea geornlice hine ahsodon, hu \u00fe\u00e6t gelumpe. Cw\u00e6\u00f0 he: Sona mid \u00fey \u00fee seo f\u00e6mne mid \u00fe\u00e6re cyste, \u00fee heo b\u00e6r, geneolecte \u00fe\u00e6m cafertune \u00fe\u00e6s \u00dea sealde seo abbudisse him sumne d\u00e6l \u00fe\u00e6re moldan; & seo m\u00e6ssepreost orationem r\u00e6dde, & Ond si\u00f0\u00fean of \u00fe\u00e6re tide \u00fea wrygedan gastas hine mid n\u00e6nige ege ne mid geswencnisse gretan \u00c6fter \u00f0issum w\u00e6s \u00e6fterfylgendre tide sum cneoht in \u00fe\u00e6m mynstre in Beardan ea in longre \u00dea w\u00e6s sume d\u00e6ge, \u00fe\u00e6tte he sorgende b\u00e6d hwonne seo a\u00f0l to him cwome, \u00fea w\u00e6s gongende in Aris & gong to cirican to \u00fe\u00e6s halgan Oswaldes lice,",
